{"logId": "28869ce8-b535-4970-9325-9fe3c541d402", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [320, 121, 888, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）尊重子女自由恋爱和选择婚姻：家庭聚会时友善地对待子女的恋爱对象；不要直接对成年子女说你不喜欢/很讨厌他/她的恋人，用挑剔或激烈的态度反对", "block_bbox": [338, 230, 1545, 306], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[337.689208984375, 230.04275512695312], [1543.9793701171875, 225.04159545898438], [1544.2901611328125, 299.9988708496094], [338.0, 305.0000305175781]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、懂得感谢孩子", "block_bbox": [341, 317, 548, 348], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[341.0, 317.0], [548.0, 317.0], [548.0, 348.0], [341.0, 348.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）感谢孩子给我们带来的快乐，彼此给予和共同成长", "block_bbox": [356, 360, 992, 392], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[356.0, 360.0], [992.0, 360.0], [992.0, 392.0], [356.0, 392.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）学习孩子身上的长处：简单、纯真、快乐、好奇心", "block_bbox": [357, 403, 991, 435], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[357.0, 403.0], [991.0, 403.0], [991.0, 435.0], [357.0, 435.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 504, 507, 536], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 504.0], [507.0, 504.0], [507.0, 536.0], [311.0, 536.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、把更多的关注和爱给予孩子，自己的选择和幸福可以为孩子做出让步", "block_bbox": [334, 565, 1172, 597], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 565.0], [1172.0, 565.0], [1172.0, 597.0], [334.0, 597.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、希望孩子快乐成长，但对孩子也有期望和要求（比如：希望孩子听话、考上好的学校、有好的工作等）", "block_bbox": [334, 608, 1547, 640], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 608.0], [1547.0, 608.0], [1547.0, 640.0], [334.0, 640.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、只注重孩子知识方面的提升，缺乏生活常识、基本生活技能等方面的培养和教育", "block_bbox": [333, 651, 1303, 683], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[333.0, 651.0], [1303.0, 651.0], [1303.0, 683.0], [333.0, 683.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、经常用自己的认知和人生经验教育、要求孩子，不让孩子走“弯路”", "block_bbox": [335, 694, 1158, 725], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 694.0], [1158.0, 694.0], [1158.0, 725.0], [335.0, 725.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、对于孩子生活上的照顾无微不至、亲力亲为，让孩子把更多精力和时间放在学习上", "block_bbox": [335, 737, 1330, 769], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 737.0], [1330.0, 737.0], [1330.0, 769.0], [335.0, 769.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、每天或频繁给成年子女联系，过分密切会失去各自独立和享受生活的空间", "block_bbox": [335, 781, 1224, 812], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 781.0], [1224.0, 781.0], [1224.0, 812.0], [335.0, 812.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、因为牵挂或担心子女，长期影响自己的生活或生命", "block_bbox": [334, 823, 963, 855], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 823.0], [963.0, 823.0], [963.0, 855.0], [334.0, 855.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_conte